{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對拆機維修博主楊長順直播中徒手撕下iPhone Duo內屏\"磨砂膜\"一事，<strong>蘋果客服今天回應稱，視頻中被撕下的是納米紋理表層、並非普通磨砂膜，正常情況下非人為刻意損壞時該層鑲嵌在設備內部撕不下來，也不會無緣無故脱落。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583520.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.851836+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:32:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"20de2742f549d971b412060d102c22f6486f02e40c5c43eb93dae9af8c3b68fa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}